  "ruleText": "Ath 102.03 \"Board\" means \"board\" as defined in RSA 326-G:1, I, namely, \"the governing board of athletic trainers established in RSA 328-F.\"\n\nSource. #8345, eff 5-7-05; ss by #9872, eff 2-24-11; ss by #12946, eff 12-20-19 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ath 100); ss by #14373, eff 9-19-25",
